                        "entry_id": "0697a08e-2067-3f58-ae0c-1df7f56d11d1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A discourse or colloquy by four people."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a392ec35-657b-426d-b608-01b333d23d89",
                                "sense_id": "052248c5-7c5c-3e6a-962d-5232b63637ca",
                                "text": "one of the first, things I did was to form a quadralogue between the Navy, in particular trie Secretary of the Navy, the Assistant Secretary for Systems Analysis, and myself (including our staffs, of course), and the subcommittee"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc8bac82-0959-4f02-ace4-98cd7c4a9fd6",
                                "sense_id": "052248c5-7c5c-3e6a-962d-5232b63637ca",
                                "text": "The consequence was that the Indian session often became a quadralogue with all the members speaking at once."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5beac24c-b4eb-4464-aa86-440a76d2154c",
                                "sense_id": "052248c5-7c5c-3e6a-962d-5232b63637ca",
                                "text": "Our discussion with the work of art is in fact not a dialogue but a quadralogue between the work of art and reality and two viewers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32a2e6d4-2677-4746-a02d-4ed1c19112da",
                                "sense_id": "052248c5-7c5c-3e6a-962d-5232b63637ca",
                                "text": "In the preferred Dostoevskian model, the author creates a genuine dialogue or perhaps trialogue or quadralogue, that is, a polyphony, in which each voice plays an unchallenged role."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
